WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.038
You are about to sign a lease.

00:00:02.038 --> 00:00:03.646
Have you read every clause?

00:00:03.646 --> 00:00:04.779
Almost nobody does.

00:00:04.779 --> 00:00:05.434
Meet Brief.

00:00:06.245 --> 00:00:13.776
Drop in a lease, a loan, or a job offer, and Brief explains it clause by clause, with the exact words behind every answer.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:18.057
Sign in with Google, tell Brief what brings you here, and you are in.

00:00:20.738 --> 00:00:25.047
A friendly tour points out every part, and it follows you from page to page.

00:00:28.206 --> 00:00:29.299
No contract handy?

00:00:29.299 --> 00:00:30.574
Try the sample lease.

00:00:33.072 --> 00:00:35.888
Or take photos of the pages with your phone.

00:00:35.888 --> 00:00:41.136
Up to five photos become one document, one page for each, in the order you choose.

00:00:49.317 --> 00:00:53.434
Brief reads it into numbered clauses, then builds the overview for you.

00:00:53.434 --> 00:00:55.521
Every key term comes with its quote.

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:58.768
Click one, and the exact words light up in the document.

00:00:59.574 --> 00:01:04.694
Then it lists the questions people forget to ask, with wording you can send to the other side.

00:01:05.506 --> 00:01:07.081
Ask anything in plain words.

00:01:07.081 --> 00:01:13.719
Every answer points to the clause it came from, and if the document does not say, Brief tells you instead of guessing.

00:01:14.821 --> 00:01:19.386
Back on your dashboard, one tap on Ready to open takes you straight to your documents.

00:01:20.198 --> 00:01:21.748
Need a second pair of eyes?

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:25.940
Share your dashboard for a time you choose, from one hour to ninety days.

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:29.844
Brief writes the invitation, with the link and code, ready to email.

00:01:29.844 --> 00:01:31.739
You can take it back at any time.

00:01:32.547 --> 00:01:34.363
Deleted something by mistake?

00:01:34.363 --> 00:01:36.366
The Bin keeps it for seven days.

00:01:36.366 --> 00:01:41.187
Turn on two-step verification, and pick light, dark, or follow your computer.

00:01:45.631 --> 00:01:47.953
Brief explains what a document says.

00:01:47.953 --> 00:01:49.436
It is not legal advice.

00:01:49.436 --> 00:01:50.468
Understand more.

00:01:50.468 --> 00:01:51.242
Search less.
